:: StoryTitle
The Light Before Dawn

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "luce-prima-dellalba",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
Ray lights up softly and brightens the path before you. With its light you can see better, understand where to go, and help anyone who has lost the way.

[[Shine ahead->inizio-avventura]]

:: inizio-avventura
Even the brightest light begins with a spark. Play with courage. Looking carefully before acting is already a special power.

:: evento-round-4 [mid-story]
Dawn is close. In its light, even the greatest strength seems less frightening.

```gameEffects
{
  "halfElementBonus": true,
  "roundSpecific": 4
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
You brought a gentle dawn into the world around you. Now you know that the best light is the one that guides without blinding.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
Night may seem long, but it never lasts forever. Your ray will soon light the road again.
